WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.599
Peter and Benjamin hopped past the shop.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.059
Suddenly Peter stopped.

3
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:15.315
"Look!" he said. "Candy! Let's get some."

4
00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:18.883
"Do you have any money?" Benjamin asked.

5
00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:22.405
"No," Peter said. "Do you?"

6
00:00:22.406 --> 00:00:28.317
Benjamin sighed. "No."

7
00:00:28.318 --> 00:00:32.118
The bunnies hopped away sadly.

8
00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:35.195
Then Peter saw something else.

9
00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:38.684
"An old boot!" he cried.

10
00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:41.600
Benjamin looked at the boot.

11
00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:44.396
"It's a nice brown boot.

12
00:00:44.397 --> 00:00:47.243
Let's take it to the shopkeeper."

13
00:00:47.244 --> 00:00:49.293
"Yes!" Peter said.

14
00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:58.947
"Then he will give us candy!"

15
00:00:58.954 --> 00:01:03.241
The bunnies dragged the boot to the shop.

16
00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:08.265
The shopkeeper frowned. "One boot?

17
00:01:08.266 --> 00:01:11.100
What can I do with one boot?"

18
00:01:11.101 --> 00:01:13.689
"You can sell it," Peter said.

19
00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:18.002
"You can put things in it," Benjamin said.

20
00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:25.368
The shopkeeper looked at the boot again.

21
00:01:25.369 --> 00:01:30.541
"Okay," he said. "I will take it."

22
00:01:30.542 --> 00:01:35.046
The shopkeeper took the boot.

23
00:01:35.047 --> 00:01:39.084
Peter and Benjamin got some candy.

24
00:01:39.085 --> 00:01:46.854
The bunnies were happy now.

25
00:01:46.855 --> 00:01:50.459
As they hopped away, they saw a mouse.

26
00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:59.193
"My house is gone!" she cried.

27
00:01:59.194 --> 00:02:04.711
"It is an old brown boot."

